What happens: The entire Frame (headers, data, checksum) is converted into raw binary pulses (0s and 1s).

How it moves:

Over Ethernet cables: Electrical voltage changes.

Over Fiber optics: Pulses of laser light.

Over Wi-Fi: Radio waves modulated at 2.4 GHz or 5 GHz.

The Analogy: The physical road surface and the spinning wheels carrying the truck from point A to point B.
